# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 02 PARTIAL FILLS
# A resting GTC order that is partially filled keeps its original queue # position (same seq), even while later orders join the same price.
# An incoming GTC order that partially fills rests the remainder at the back of the queue at its limit price.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PLACE 1 A SELL LIMIT 100 10 GTC
PLACE 2 B SELL LIMIT 100 10 GTC
PLACE 3 X BUY LIMIT 100 3 GTC       # #1 -> leaves 7, still first in queue
STATUS 1
PLACE 4 C SELL LIMIT 100 5 GTC      # joins behind #1 and #2
DEPTH ORDERS
PLACE 5 Y BUY LIMIT 100 3 GTC       # #1 again (priority retained) -> leaves 4
DEPTH ORDERS
PLACE 6 Z BUY LIMIT 100 12 GTC      # #1 4 (filled), #2 8 (leaves 2)
DEPTH ORDERS
STATUS 1
STATUS 2
# Incoming partial: 10 wanted, only 2 (#2) + 5 (#4) available -> 3 rests as a bid.
PLACE 7 W BUY LIMIT 100 10 GTC
STATUS 7
TOP